{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWelcome, Player. Let me tell you a story\u2026 and let\u2019s find out why this world is dead.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/3ff7ed5a581d3bc838eb14212f08f19e.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World Tales is a narrative puzzle roguelite in which each playthrough is a story\u2014and every story is a clue to the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You delve into a universe fragmented by past decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You journey through dark fables and symbolic worlds using a tic\u2011tac\u2011toe\u2013based puzzle system, reinvented with new mechanics and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each tale, you take on the role of a different character with their own dilemma: from sorcerers defying death to civilizations that have forgotten their purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncovering each character\u2019s destiny doesn\u2019t just determine their individual outcome\u2014it also brings you closer to the truth behind the world\u2019s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/7390ac571de946415d3da3320d2a9938.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tic\u2011tac\u2011toe\u2013based puzzles</strong>: strategic twists that represent narrative decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets</strong>: each level hides mysteries and easter\u2011eggs, some of which help you unveil the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and philosophical stories</strong>: self\u2011contained tales full of choices, symbols, and moral dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>: the combination of levels and decisions lets you unlock secret levels and story conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Failure is not the end</strong>: failing a level doesn\u2019t end your run; it offers an alternative story outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro visual style</strong>: art that evokes the era of PS2 games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the metanarrative</strong>: interpret the stories and connect their consequences to piece together the past and face the end.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Phantom thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/13816bb381b202b3f781a844d36ce78ed0523c37.jpg"},{"name":"Jackpot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/a889b58ef4552fc5f11ee6695b7e31c6e0503a57.jpg"},{"name":"Icor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/5276297ca6422f4f7ff12b6d12199ffce229a044.jpg"},{"name":"Key of the Dead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/96d16e31c22b796b85c9d1ffffdf9a1a1cba5fc1.jpg"},{"name":"Stardust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/37b8041903c5dbfde8ceb47c19ce9ab152aaa26b.jpg"},{"name":"Close to the truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/f600e9ca82085a6d1a63ffcfaa64ba8a29792fd5.jpg"},{"name":"Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/fa9b723664ff23175cd48ff4053bd765fe48505e.jpg"},{"name":"Lottery number","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/30e4238e9c0adcdce9bcc067f31be11699993f7b.jpg"},{"name":"Home delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/136122d9497e3289959c9eb73d7c2056ee4ebf2f.jpg"},{"name":"Explosion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3895020/f5b576634db5dc5a58908a2cdeba8ae48063d6b0.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895020?t=1763745539","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895020?t=1763745539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/12c51d015743ea23f207cef38bb507d6262e1eb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763745539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/12c51d015743ea23f207cef38bb507d6262e1eb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763745539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWelcome, Player. Let me tell you a story\u2026 and let\u2019s find out why this world is dead.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/203c6206edb3378b3583a1793af52f8e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/3ff7ed5a581d3bc838eb14212f08f19e.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead World Tales is a narrative puzzle roguelite in which each playthrough is a story\u2014and every story is a clue to the end of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You delve into a universe fragmented by past decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You journey through dark fables and symbolic worlds using a tic\u2011tac\u2011toe\u2013based puzzle system, reinvented with new mechanics and consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each tale, you take on the role of a different character with their own dilemma: from sorcerers defying death to civilizations that have forgotten their purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncovering each character\u2019s destiny doesn\u2019t just determine their individual outcome\u2014it also brings you closer to the truth behind the world\u2019s collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.poster.avif?t=1763745539\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.webm?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/8a48a9dde2ea8bea7bb34f62b74c8b5e.mp4?t=1763745539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/extras/7390ac571de946415d3da3320d2a9938.avif?t=1763745539\" width=1319 height=251 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tic\u2011tac\u2011toe\u2013based puzzles</strong>: strategic twists that represent narrative decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets</strong>: each level hides mysteries and easter\u2011eggs, some of which help you unveil the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark and philosophical stories</strong>: self\u2011contained tales full of choices, symbols, and moral dilemmas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple endings</strong>: the combination of levels and decisions lets you unlock secret levels and story conclusions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Failure is not the end</strong>: failing a level doesn\u2019t end your run; it offers an alternative story outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro visual style</strong>: art that evokes the era of PS2 games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the metanarrative</strong>: interpret the stories and connect their consequences to piece together the past and face the end.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Demiurgames"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895020/e3fb0760a535dc7424b49dfde02dfa7e5c495d57/header.jpg?t=1763745539","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Demiurgames. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nThis product was developed with Unreal Engine 5.4.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895020/1655130111/514ade55bc1a619e6955c5a286c9d83253be5050/1762599733/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762600558","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895020/1655130111/514ade55bc1a619e6955c5a286c9d83253be5050/1762599733/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762600558","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895020/1655130111/514ade55bc1a619e6955c5a286c9d83253be5050/1762599733/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762600558","id":257228554,"name":"Trailer Corrected","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228554/6dddf812f1ccbe8f228848ce750fa950ed130276/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762600558"}],"name"